[l_english.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_CARBINE]
Carbine (Infantry)

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_CARBINE_desc]
The Carbine, named after Carbine, a mysterious identity who apparently doesn’t exist in Equestria, is a compact and lightweight firearm designed for those who prefer to swiftly deliver a dose of friendship, or well, a small lead ball, to their adversaries. While it may be small in size, it packs enough punch to make even a griffon think twice before crossing your path. Yeah, I mean friendship.
§g“I don’t know who Carbine is, but that human, if that’s the right name for his species, surely knows how to party.”§!

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_CARBINE_short]
Carbine

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_CARBINE]
卡宾枪 (步兵装备)

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_CARBINE_desc]
卡宾枪，以卡宾——某个显然不存在于小马利亚的神秘人物命名，是一种小巧轻便的枪支，非常适合小马们迫不及待地向对手传递他们的友谊，或者他们的小铅球。虽然它的体积小，但它的威力足以让狮鹫在经过你面前时三思而后行。对，我说的是友谊。
§g“我不知道卡宾是谁，但那个人类——如果这是他的物种的名字的话，显然知道怎么开派对。”§!

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_RANGED_CARBINE_short]
卡宾枪
